---
title: Order flow
---
flowchart TD
  A([Customer order]) --> B{In stock?}
  B -- Yes --> C[Reserve items]
  B -- No --> D[Notify customer]
  subgraph Fulfilment
    direction LR
    C --> E[(Warehouse DB)]
    E --> F[Ship order]
  end
  F --> G((Done))
  A -.->|audit log| G
  D --> H{{Retry later?}}
  H ==>|yes| B
  H --> G
  style G fill:#b7e4c7
